{"transcript":"jʊər ˈwɛlkəm","exists":true,"definitions":["A polite reply when someone thanks you.","Used to indicate that a favor was no trouble or was a pleasure."],"examples":["\"Thanks for your help!\" \"You're welcome.\"","\"I appreciate it.\" \"You're welcome, anytime.\""],"lemma":"you're welcome","lemmaPos":"interjection","synonyms":["no problem","my pleasure","don't mention it","anytime"],"number":"singular","source":"you're welcome","frequency":8}